<title>JAPAN: Canon -6mth group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Canon -6mth group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.22 trln	 vs	    1.01 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  101.49		vs	   60.12</p>
<p> Pretax	     86.02		vs	   48.38</p>
<p> Net		   40.29		vs	   21.30</p>
<p> EPS		   45.76 yen	  vs	   24.35 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Canon Inc is a manufacturer of printers, copiers and computer peripherals. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
